		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Goblin-sized humanoid. Large almond-shaped black eyes, small nose, thin mouth, clammy gray skin. Abduct and experiment on mortals.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 14, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 touch +1 (overload) or probe or paralysis, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> -1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Overload</strong>. Stunned for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Paralysis</strong>. One mortal within near, CON 15+ or paralyzed for 1d4 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Phase</strong>. Become momentarily incorporeal, walk through walls or solid objects at half movement.</p><p></p><p><strong>Probe</strong>. Telepathically extract information from helpless target within near, WIS 15+ or answer one question.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
